# ==========================================
# ALLOWED ESSENTIAL FILES
# ==========================================

# Keep these files (explicitly not ignored)
!README.md
!requirements.txt
!config/config.py
!config/unified_config.py
!config/templates/
!config/templates/*.yaml
!docs/
!docs/*.md
docs/CRITICAL_STRATEGY_IMPLEMENTATION_GUIDE.md
docs/TASKS.md
!src/

# Keep small sample data files for testing (if needed)
!data/samples/
!data/examples/

# Keep configuration templates
!config/templates/

# ==========================================
# NOTES
# ==========================================

# This .gitignore is designed for an algorithmic trading backtester
# It protects sensitive trading data, API keys, and credentials
# while preserving the core system architecture and documentation
# 
# Key priorities:
# 1. Security: Prevent accidental exposure of API keys and tokens
# 2. Clean repository: Exclude generated outputs and temporary files
# 3. Development: Allow essential files while ignoring build artifacts
# 4. Flexibility: Easy to modify for specific deployment needs

# ==========================================
# RELEASE HYGIENE EXTRAS
# ==========================================
.claude/
.worktrees/
candles/
hist_data/
temp_*/
temp_*.py
Backtesting System Audit Report.txt
